===Etymology 2===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵews-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|chose}}, {{m|enm|chos}}, {{m|enm|chooce}}, a Northern dialectal form of {{m+|enm|chois|t=choice}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|chose}}, {{m|sco|choose}}, {{m|sco|chuse|t=choosing, choice, selection}}. {{doublet|en|choice}}, which see for more.

